<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SoundWave | Contact</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />

    <%- include('../partials/user/theme-config') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-background-soft" style='font-family:"Space Grotesk","Noto Sans",sans-serif;'>
    <%- include('../partials/user/navbar') %>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-10 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-10">
        <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8 lg:p-10 xl:p-12">
            <nav class="mb-4 flex text-sm text-gray-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                <ol class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-2">
                    <li class="inline-flex items-center">
                        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-500 hover:text-primary">
                            Home
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li aria-current="page">
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-primary">Contact</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="max-w-6xl space-y-8">
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-primary-light/10 p-5 md:p-6 lg:p-7">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5">
                        <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-primary-light/50 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-primary shadow-sm">
                            <div class="size-4">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M24 45.8096C19.6865 45.8096 15.4698 44.5305 11.8832 42.134C8.29667 39.7376 5.50128 36.3314 3.85056 32.3462C2.19985 28.361 1.76794 23.9758 2.60947 19.7452C3.451 15.5145 5.52816 11.6284 8.57829 8.5783C11.6284 5.52817 15.5145 3.45101 19.7452 2.60948C23.9758 1.76795 28.361 2.19986 32.3462 3.85057C36.3314 5.50129 39.7376 8.29668 42.134 11.8833C44.5305 15.4698 45.8096 19.6865 45.8096 24L24 24L24 45.8096Z" fill="currentColor" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold">SoundWave</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-3">
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary/70">Contact Support</p>
                            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">We are here to help with your SoundWave questions.</h1>
                            <p class="max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
                                If you need help with a product, an order-related question, or general store support, you can reach us directly by email.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-gray-700 md:text-[1.02rem] lg:text-[1.045rem]">
                    <p class="text-justify">We aim to keep communication simple, clear, and useful. Whether you need help understanding a product, checking on an order, or resolving a shopping issue, we want the support experience to feel as straightforward as the storefront itself.</p>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-white p-5 md:p-6">
                        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary/70">Support Email</p>
                        <a href="mailto:soundwave.audiostore@gmail.com" class="mt-3 inline-flex break-all text-xl font-bold text-primary hover:underline md:text-2xl">
                            soundwave.audiostore@gmail.com
                        </a>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-justify text-gray-700">
                            For product support and queries contact: <span class="font-semibold text-primary">soundwave.audiostore@gmail.com</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify">Sending us a clear subject line and a short description of your question helps us respond more efficiently. If your message is about a recent order, including the relevant order details will make it easier for us to assist you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
